      terminations retained. Inner shell is an explicit teaching approximation, not
      segmented tissue thickness. Lumen sample validation finding: cutting disabled
      until resolved. Initial offset failed lumen samples; replaced with 0.1 mm authored
      teaching wall. See qa/reports/lumen-wall-adjustments.json. Lumen sample validation
      finding: cutting disabled until resolved. Lumen sample validation finding:
      cutting disabled until resolved.'
